### Proof: practices/day55-practice/exercise4-proof.txt

### Stateless Gotcha
Must explicitly allow return traffic:
Inbound port 80 (browser → server)
Outbound ports 1024-65535 (server → browser response)
SG handles this automatically (stateful)
NACL requires both rules explicitly

