## VPC Advanced Topics

### VPC Endpoints (save NAT GW costs)
Gateway endpoint: S3 and DynamoDB (FREE)
Interface endpoint: other services (~$7/month)
Private subnet → S3 without internet

### VPC Peering
Connect two VPCs (same or different accounts)
NO transitive routing (must peer each pair)
For hub-spoke: use Transit Gateway

### VPC Flow Logs
Capture all traffic metadata
ACCEPT/REJECT per connection
Use for: security audit, debugging, compliance

